    "description": "ICLOUD-025: 'Your device hasn't given access to display your files' with no way through. Rules I1 and O1: a join that cannot finish says so (sign-in-needed), the recovery code is the way through, and the drive is untouched meanwhile.",
    "pending": "drive_open joined:false (a device without the drive key); drive_join {device, approver, pause_at: \"approve\"} (AzDrive's device approval: the approver wraps the drive key for the new device; paused before the approval lands, drive_cont finishes it); drive_recover {device} (the recovery-code flow)",
